WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Direct an applet factory: build, check, review, refine. Then decide what reaches your screen.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Describe the applet in the current Studio. This example prompt is typed, not submitted.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Connect your own AI provider and choose a model. Keys stay in the open session.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Native scenario checks test real output. This original racer fixture passed all seven cases.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
AI image review offers critique on intent, hierarchy, legibility, contrast and meaning. It is advisory.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Native failures and visual findings feed bounded repair. At most two repairs across the build.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Chat leads the factory. Editable source and detailed checks remain within reach.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:58.000
Connect with the Device ID and API token from your Tidbyt phone app. Sending stays explicit.

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:06.000
Explore Pixbyt Studio. Bring your own AI key to build; inspect the pixels before sending.

